# .env.tpl.example — documents the op:// secret-reference pattern for operators.
#
# Narrowstack house rule (secrets bright-line): committed env templates contain
# op:// references ONLY, never literal secret values. Resolve them at provision
# time with the 1Password CLI:
#
#   op run --env-file=compose/t1-full/.env.tpl -- ./deploy/green-check.sh manifest/examples/t1-dogfood.yaml
#
# Copy the topology-specific template you need:
#   - T1 (full VM):        compose/t1-full/.env.tpl
#   - T2 (external attach): provide WAREHOUSE_DSN from the manifest external_dsn_ref
#
# Example reference form:
#   SOME_PASSWORD=op://<vault>/<tenant>-core/<FIELD>
